# Force LF line endings on every platform so release-source byte identity is
# stable across GitHub-hosted Linux, macOS, and Windows checkout lanes.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Explicitly keep binary assets untouched by any line-ending normalization.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.whl binary
*.pyc binary